OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a press conference on Sunday
OL,7,Fafternoon, police spokesperson Bernhard
OL,8,FGraser reiterated the force has "no
OL,9,Finformation about the perpetrator(s) or
OL,10,Ftheir motive". They are not believed to
OL,11,Fbe in Aarau anymore, he added.
